IQ Boost is a game with tricky puzzles, tasks and logic tests. 
All the tasks are original and funny! We said ‘NO’ to boring brain training.
Free IQ Boost game features only the best tasks, brainteasers and exercises to train your memory, attention, logic and mindset. 

Only 10% of all the people have an IQ higher than 120. Are you among them? Play IQ Boost - challenge your brain.

Try yourself in solving nontrivial tasks. You will train logical and abstract thinking by solving puzzles and logic tasks. Сoncentration and memory will be better too. 
Have a good time while training your brain. 

Find out your IQ level. Lower than you thought? Play IQ Boost and you’ll see your IQ is growing. 

Game features:
• Easy to play;
• Nonstandard colourful gameplay;
• Funny answers and solutions;
• Nontrivial challenges for any age;
• Lots of levels;
• Intellectual brain-teaser game.

Remember: obvious solutions might not be not always right...think out of the box and train your brain! Play and prove you are the cleverest!

Game Introduction
The game adopts a horizontal style graphics design, and you need to control the matchmaker in the game to complete various task challenges. You can constantly adventure through level breaking. As levels increase, the difficulty will also increase. Interested players should download and give it a try!

Game Details
This is a horizontal action challenge game that combines RPG growth elements, controls Matchman to shoot various monsters along the way, collects experience and coins, continuously strengthens oneself, and challenges the most powerful monsters.
In the game, you need to break through various game levels, with different levels having different levels of difficulty. The only way to break through a level is to eliminate all the enemies in the game. Only by eliminating all the enemies can you have a chance to smoothly enter the next level.

Game Features
1. A plethora of levels and weapons;
2. Classic image and rich cultivation elements;
3. Use powerful firepower to maintain an invincible position.

Game evaluation
1. In different game levels, you need to perform various game operations. During this process, you need to command your matchmaker and eliminate other enemies;
2. While performing various operations, you must not forget to always observe the enemy's position, only in this way can you quickly familiarize yourself with the game and understand it thoroughly;
3. You must understand the rules in the game clearly, only then can you master the game and control the game rhythm stably.

Game gameplay
1. Continuously accumulating and mastering game operations through various levels of the game will help you become more proficient in game operations;
2. Continuously familiarize and experience different game operations during the game process, allowing you to have various excellent gaming experiences that do not exceed what you provide;
3. The matchmaker needs to perform various operations in the level, and quick operations can help you pass the level faster.
